      "writtenOn": "2019-02-09T21:15:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the reason is that the MAC implementation will use asm on amd64 but the generic implementation on e.g. arm. But sum_noasm.go is ignored on arm. So merging them into a single\nfile causes the build to fail. However, when there is also an arm and s390x asm implementation of MAC then we could merge sum_noasm.go and hash_noasm.go\n\nAlso, will rename hash_noasm.go -\u003e mac_noasm.go based on review comments.",
      "parentUuid": "de38f8ed_c07bc007",
      "revId": "61db2325307c89941b5fad96707c83cc36665b82",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": true
